6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I am interested in the human element. I'll look into the unplanned talk since the refit and where the last awkward conversation happened.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,I want to see where the time is going. I'll check the round trip for a hot lunch and the facilities callouts on this floor.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
