25,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"It's clear the room is used unevenly, and the cleaning is a burden on just one person.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
26,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"We've lost our spaces for spontaneous connection, and private matters are being handled far too publicly.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
27,2,1,talk,May,,"People are spending a lot of time walking for food, and the equipment maintenance is a recurring issue.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
28,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"We're wasting a significant amount of money on external rentals for tiny groups, and the fit-out costs vary.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
29,2,1,talk,Servas,,"The walls are far too thin for privacy, and the lack of a proper eating area is affecting our desks.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
30,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Shunichi, if we are paying for outside rooms, wouldn't a dedicated internal space save us that cost?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Servas, if the walls are that thin, a room for loud activities would be a nightmare for those nearby.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,2,talk,May,,"@Ryuji, but if it's just a few people using it, is it worth the upkeep?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,The external costs are exactly why we need a solution. We're paying for things we could do here.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,2,talk,Servas,,I agree with Jonathan. The noise travels. But the crumbs at the desks are a different kind of nuisance.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"The fridge situation proves that without a system, the room just becomes a dumping ground.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,I feel we are becoming strangers. We need a place where we can actually speak honestly.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,3,talk,May,,Twenty-five minutes for lunch is a lot of wasted time. A kitchen would solve that.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"A meeting space is cheaper to fit out than a kitchen, but the external hire costs are the real drain.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,3,talk,Servas,,We must balance the need for a break with the peace of those working right next to the door.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
