50,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Option C seems the most organized. A calendar prevents the ""first-come"" chaos I found in the records.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,Option C provides a dedicated space for those awkward or important conversations that currently happen in public.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,3,1,talk,May,,Option A is the most practical for our daily routine. No more long walks for hot food.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,Option C stops the bleeding of money on outside rentals. It's the most rational financial move.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,3,1,talk,Servas,,"Option B would be a blessing for the noise levels, but Option C is a fair compromise if managed.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@May, a kitchen sounds like more cleaning duties for the same few people.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@May, would a kitchen really encourage us to talk, or just eat in silence?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,2,talk,May,,"@Ryuji, we could just be better about the cleaning! The time saved on lunch is worth it.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@May, the cost of the kitchen fit-out is lower, but the external hire is for meetings, not lunch.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,2,talk,Servas,,"@Jonathan, a quiet room is peaceful, but perhaps too restrictive for a small office.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,I can't support Option A. The maintenance burden is too high. I'm voting C.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I value the peace of B, but the need for communication makes C the better choice.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,3,talk,May,,"I still think A is the best for morale, but I see the point about the cleaning.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,The numbers don't lie. We need a meeting space. I vote C.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,3,talk,Servas,,"Given the thin walls, B is tempting, but C serves a professional need we are currently paying for.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,4,pass,Ryuji,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
66,3,4,talk,Jonathan,,I'll vote for C to help us reconnect.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,4,talk,May,,I'll stick with A. I want my lunch break back.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,4,pass,Shunichi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
69,3,4,talk,Servas,,I will vote for C as well. It's the most balanced.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
